  "decision": "REJECT BOTH VARIANTS. Loop version increases targeted transform medians High2.0\u21922.6ms andLow2.2\u21922.5ms, despite modest pooled submission improvement. Unrolled final High submission12.3\u219214.6msmedian/17.5\u219218.8p95 and transforms1.5\u21922.5msmedian/2.0\u21923.0p95 are worse; Low submission improves8.35\u21926.85ms but transform median1.85\u21921.95ms. Shared-host timing and fixed prepared scenes cannot establish a broad causal speedup. Do not select cache or run another unchanged full party to justify it. Preserve held renderer arithmetic and dirty/force behavior.",
